{"id":"040fbbfdb52f2389","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets.md","title":"集合量词的伴随","display":"thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets — 集合量词的伴随","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets","aliases":["16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets","16-quantifier-adjointness-sets"],"display":"thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets — 集合量词的伴随","depends_on":["[[16-df-pred-fibration]]"],"source":"§§3.3, 4.1 and 9.1, powerset quantification; explicit set-theoretic proof","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets</span><span>16-quantifier-adjointness-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets — 集合量词的伴随"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"26dec4f877ca3671\" href=\"?note=26dec4f877ca3671\" title=\"16-df-pred-fibration\">16-df-pred-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§§3.3, 4.1 and 9.1, powerset quantification; explicit set-theoretic proof"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 为集合函数；各幂集以包含关系为序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*:\\mathcal P(J)\\to\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(u^*:\\mathcal P(J)\\to\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_u,\\forall_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)\">\\(\\exists_u,\\forall_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)\\)</span> 是下节定义的运算；各定义式的输入分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\subseteq J\">\\(Y\\subseteq J\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq I\">\\(X\\subseteq I\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u^*(Y)\\coloneqq u^{-1}[Y],\\qquad\\exists_u(X)\\coloneqq u[X],\\qquad\\forall_u(X)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid u^{-1}[\\{j\\}]\\subseteq X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u^*(Y)\\coloneqq u^{-1}[Y],\\qquad\\exists_u(X)\\coloneqq u[X],\\qquad\\forall_u(X)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid u^{-1}[\\{j\\}]\\subseteq X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}adjointness\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists_u\\dashv u^*\\dashv\\forall_u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}adjointness\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists_u\\dashv u^*\\dashv\\forall_u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall X\\subseteq I)(\\forall Y\\subseteq J)\\quad\n\\exists_u(X)\\subseteq Y&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq u^*(Y),\\\\\nu^*(Y)\\subseteq X&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\forall_u(X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall X\\subseteq I)(\\forall Y\\subseteq J)\\quad\n\\exists_u(X)\\subseteq Y&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq u^*(Y),\\\\\nu^*(Y)\\subseteq X&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\forall_u(X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>左伴随的证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u[X]\\subseteq Y\">\\(u[X]\\subseteq Y\\)</span> 当且仅当每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in X\">\\(i\\in X\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(i)\">\\(u(i)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq u^{-1}[Y]\">\\(X\\subseteq u^{-1}[Y]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>右伴随的证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{-1}[Y]\\subseteq X\">\\(u^{-1}[Y]\\subseteq X\\)</span> 当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in Y\">\\(j\\in Y\\)</span>，整个纤维 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{-1}[\\{j\\}]\">\\(u^{-1}[\\{j\\}]\\)</span> 都包含在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\subseteq\\forall_u(X)\">\\(Y\\subseteq\\forall_u(X)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>三个运算均单调，因此这些包含等价确实是偏序范畴的伴随。空纤维包含在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中，故未命中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 总属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_u(X)\">\\(\\forall_u(X)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本原子补上原文件缺少的 Remark 与逐元素证明，并以单元素集合的逆像明确原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{-1}(j)\">\\(u^{-1}(j)\\)</span> 记号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§§3.3, 4.1 and 9.1, powerset quantification; explicit set-theoretic proof。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-pred-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"26dec4f877ca3671","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pred-fibration]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"u^*:\\mathcal P(J)\\to\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists_u,\\forall_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\subseteq J","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq I","display":false},{"tex":"u^*(Y)\\coloneqq u^{-1}[Y],\\qquad\\exists_u(X)\\coloneqq u[X],\\qquad\\forall_u(X)\\coloneqq\\{j\\in J\\mid u^{-1}[\\{j\\}]\\subseteq X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}adjointness\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\\quad\n\\exists_u\\dashv u^*\\dashv\\forall_u.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\forall X\\subseteq I)(\\forall Y\\subseteq J)\\quad\n\\exists_u(X)\\subseteq Y&\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq u^*(Y),\\\\\nu^*(Y)\\subseteq X&\\Longleftrightarrow Y\\subseteq\\forall_u(X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"u[X]\\subseteq Y","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"u(i)","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq u^{-1}[Y]","display":false},{"tex":"u^{-1}[Y]\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in Y","display":false},{"tex":"u^{-1}[\\{j\\}]","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\subseteq\\forall_u(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall_u(X)","display":false},{"tex":"u^{-1}(j)","display":false}],"bytes":1974,"backlinks":[{"id":"f993a9408cb8e9d4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\exists_u$ 是逆像 $u^{*}$ 的左伴随；完整伴随式见 [[16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets]]。"},{"id":"093190b59177ac14","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Jacobs, §0.2, p. 12（PDF 32）。量词伴随见 [[16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets]]。"},{"id":"7977665ec7a5feef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"伴随的子集等价式见 [[16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-441","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets|thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets — 集合量词的伴随]]"},{"id":"cd9b40487a8c180f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\exists_u,\\forall_u:\\mathcal P(I)\\to\\mathcal P(J)$ 是 [[16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets]] 定义的直接像与全称纤维量词；不取任意同型候选函数。"}],"outgoing":["26dec4f877ca3671"]}